        /// <returns>One statement for the children and one for the parents.</returns>
        /// <remarks>
        /// <c>parent_id</c> is <c>RESTRICT</c> and PostgreSQL checks it row by row, so the children
        /// have to go first. Both statements are public so a test can assert them without a database.
        /// </remarks>
